  "steps": [
    "Mix this all well and add water little by litle to form the perfect spreadable uttapam consistency. (Approx 1 small cup water)",
    "Heat a non-stick pan, brush it with some oil and start making your uttapams. Once its 60% cooked from the top, sprinkle 65g of low fat homemade paneer on the uttapam (use 130g for 2 uttapams) and lightly press it down with a spatula. Let it cook on slow flame for another 3-4 mins and flip.",
    "Cook until the side with paneer is golden brown.",
    "Sprinkle with podi masala and serve with green chutney."
